  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the region bounded by the curves <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;in the upper half plane is _________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given curves are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Drawing their graphs, we get&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0107_a487d5c18e4f.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 298px;\" /></p><p>The required area is shown by&nbsp;the shaded part and since the curves&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are symmetric about the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis, hence they have the same area.</p><p>Hence, the required area<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sq</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>units</mi></math>&nbsp;.</p>"
  }
